# Never touch settings without permission

See `OTHERMODS/.cursor/rules/never-touch-settings-without-permission.mdc` — same rule.

Do **not** edit `.ini`, `.cfg`, `.dat`, saves, FusionFix, ZMenu, handling, visuals, or commandline without the user explicitly approving that turn.

**Read → suggest exact change → wait for "go" → then edit.**
